{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Assemble round-trip flights, hotel nights, event tickets and a dinner table for a specific game or event in any sport, using the home city, party size and budget cap. Retains agent-supplied provider quotes with prices, sources and expiry, and marks remaining legs as quote needed. Returns an itemized itinerary, quoted subtotal, budget targets and a principal review link. POST /api/sports-plan-trip. Paid URL: 0.10 USDC per call on Base mainnet using x402 exact, under the shared 10 signed-wallet free calls over rolling 30 days. X-Wever-Wallet-Proof binds the exact JSON arguments to this API path. API access fees are separate from travel spending. Per-leg principal approval and delegated authority govern spending. Conditional escrow has a 300 USDC per-leg cap. Current sports-trip provider mode retains quotes and approvals; its receipts identify quote selection and withdrawal. Read /api/sports-trips-contract for schemas, provider availability, receipt verification and approval terms.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"budget_cap_usd":{"pattern":"^(0|[1-9][0-9]{0,5})\\.[0-9]{2}$","type":"string"},"event":{"additionalProperties":false,"anyOf":[{"required":["event_name"]},{"required":["home_team","away_team"]}],"dependencies":{"away_team":["home_team"],"home_team":["away_team"]},"properties":{"away_team":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^(?!\\s)(?![\\s\\S]*\\s$)[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]+$","type":"string"},"city":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^(?!\\s)(?![\\s\\S]*\\s$)[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]+$","type":"string"},"date":{"pattern":"^20[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$","type":"string"},"event_name":{"maxLength":160,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^(?!\\s)(?![\\s\\S]*\\s$)[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]+$","type":"string"},"home_team":{"maxLength":80,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^(?!\\s)(?![\\s\\S]*\\s$)[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]+$","ty